From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: WavJaby <WavJaby@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 6 Nov 2026 20:50:27 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] codec2: drop the FDK-AAC soft codecs from the store list

C2PlatformComponentStore lists the soft codec libraries AOSP ships. ATL
does not ship FDK-AAC (owner licence decision N3), so the decoder and
encoder libraries libcodec2_soft_aacdec.so and libcodec2_soft_aacenc.so
are removed from the list. Every other listed library is built by ATL.
ComponentModule::init keeps its fatal dlopen check: a listed library
that is missing is a build error, not a skipped codec.

Upstream-Status: Pending
Patch-Reason: FDK-AAC is excluded by licence (owner N3); the list is compiled into C2Store.cpp, so only the list can drop the entries, and a stub .so would be a second implementation
---
SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0
 media/codec2/vndk/C2Store.cpp | 3 +--
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/media/codec2/vndk/C2Store.cpp b/media/codec2/vndk/C2Store.cpp
index 7ca86c161f86d538feac38faf27f5ee34be635ca..a1f650d7f7995e9f6665cbf596e2c79495b98695 100644
--- a/media/codec2/vndk/C2Store.cpp
+++ b/media/codec2/vndk/C2Store.cpp
@@ -1175,8 +1175,7 @@ C2PlatformComponentStore::C2PlatformComponentStore()
     };
 
     // TODO: move this also into a .so so it can be updated
-    emplace("libcodec2_soft_aacdec.so");
-    emplace("libcodec2_soft_aacenc.so");
+    // ATL does not ship FDK-AAC (owner N3): libcodec2_soft_aacdec/aacenc are not listed
     emplace("libcodec2_soft_amrnbdec.so");
     emplace("libcodec2_soft_amrnbenc.so");
     emplace("libcodec2_soft_amrwbdec.so");
